d: its party totals are spread over its districts in line with each district's early-vote party mix (2%). Updated every 10 minutes from the county TQV feeds and Broward's turnout dashboard."},"election_day_mix":{"exact":2222013,"split":116761,"unmatched":98641,"estimated":59405},"election_day_as_of":"2026-11-03T23:00:05Z","data_hash":"fffdacdfb723af535d791df3f5441013bb705398b66e04e2ef08829b8985e656","generated_at":"2026-11-03T23:00:09Z"}